  "body": "Follow-up from the takeover check of PR #2716 (#1864).\n\nPR #2716 reads the sketch Z span fresh outside `operation::display_heights(..)`, and display callers read it inside that scope. `crates/ui/src/start_exit_pick.rs:160` (`marks()`) calls `operation::resolve_height` outside the scope. On the Leads tab, a Contour on a DXF sketch with a \"From: Selection\" top height then samples the sketch on each frame.\n\nThis costs frame time only. It does not change a toolpath.\n\nWork: wrap that call in `operation::display_heights(..)`, or read the height through `height_memo::height(.., None, ..)`. Add a frame-cost pin, as `frame_cost_caches` does.\n",
